# LabelAssigner.psm1
# Core logic for assigning labels to a PR based on its changed files.
#
# Public functions:
#   ConvertTo-GlobRegex  - translate a glob pattern into a .NET regex
#   Test-GlobMatch       - test whether a file path matches a glob pattern
